{"findMembers returns undefined when name is empty instead of returning Ember.RSVP.resolve([]), which breaks promise chains expecting a promise": 0.9181965589523315, "Username splitting in add_members doesn't strip whitespace, so usernames like ' alice' won't match - should use usernames.split(',').map(&:strip)": 0.8506109714508057, "BasicGroupSerializer output may not contain the basic_group wrapper expected by JS create() which expects resp.basic_group.id": 0.4762554168701172, "Inconsistent HTTP status codes for automatic groups - destroy returns 422 but semantically 403 (Forbidden) may be more appropriate than 422 (Unprocessable Entity)": 0.04532279446721077, "group.save is called after group.add/group.users.delete but group.add may already persist membership, making the extra save potentially unnecessary": 0.10000129044055939, "find_group uses Group.find_by which may return nil, and guardian.ensure_can_see! may not handle nil properly - should add explicit not_found handling for 404": 0.26682528853416443, "Indentation of protected method can_not_modify_automatic uses 4 spaces inside protected block - minor style inconsistency": 0.03024856001138687, "Missing tests for add_members/remove_member with usernames containing spaces (edge case)": 0.39521464705467224}